concepts.content:
Consider a translation by a 2D vector, $(t_x, t_y)$ as shown in @fig-translations. We'll denote the coordinates after the transformation with a prime. In heterogeneous coordinates, we have
$$\begin{pmatrix}
    x' \\
    y' 
    \end{pmatrix}
    =
    \begin{pmatrix}
    x \\
    y 
    \end{pmatrix}
    +
    \begin{pmatrix}
    t_x \\
    t_y 
    \end{pmatrix}
$$

